ughed at the farm kid with the big ideas."], [18.751, 21.682, "By twelve, I was better than men who'd trained their whole lives."], [21.899, 23.874, "People started calling me the Little Champion."], [24.174, 26.125, "Then the king nailed a poster to the town gate."], [26.311, 30.887, "Beat his Iron Champion, undefeated in a thousand duels, and win a chest of gold."], [31.109, 32.285, "I signed up that second."], [32.607, 34.833, "In the arena, the Iron Champion was already waiting."], [35.038, 38.407, "I shook his gauntlet, and just like always, I knew every move he had."], [38.619, 41.833, "But before the bell even rang, he dropped his sword. \"I yield.\""], [42.1, 44.497, "The whole arena went silent. I didn't understand."], [44.741, 48.185, "Then I saw his hand. It was shaking so hard he couldn't pick his sword back up."], [48.451, 49.368, "That's when I understood."], [49.597, 51.887, "I wasn't copying skills. I was taking them."], [52.098, 54.822, "And every knight who ever laughed at me had already shaken my h\u2014"]]}